# Duelling Colours: two long walls, offset, make lanes for a shoot-out.

NAME Duelling Colours
SYMMETRY ROT2
WALLS C M
START 20 8 S
TUNNELS                        # mouths mid-edge; drive through to the far side

# A long wall.
MOVE 10 4
DRAW 10 20

# Cover at the end of the lane.
MOVE 4 12
DRAW 6 12
